      "title": "Postdoc positie voor Implementatie van EMDR met VR in de specialistische GGZ",
      "description": "Postdoc positie voor Implementatie van EMDR met VR in de specialistische GGZ - Looking for a job that matters? Vacancies Academic staff Support staff UT Student Jobs UT as employer UT as employer Employment conditions Career and development Pre and onboarding Tenure Track PhD EngD Working as a UT student Stories from UT employees Job alert About UT Campus Research institutes Strategy and culture Twente and Enschede Nederlands English en Nederlands English Vacancies Postdoc positie voor Implementatie van EMDR met VR in de specialistische GGZ To vacancy overview Apply now BMS PostDoc Postdoc positie voor Implementatie van EMDR met VR in de specialistische GGZ This vacancy is only available in Dutch. Click here to view the vacancy in Dutch. Apply now Hi! Are you my new colleague? Kirsten Stadermann Hi! Are you my new colleague? Ipek Topan Hi! Are you my new colleague? Tanya Bondarouk Hi! Are you my new colleague? Hannie Lensink Hi! Are you my new colleague? Theodora Spirova Hi! Are you my new colleague? Abhishta Abhishta Hi! Are you my new colleague? Henk Pol Key takeaways Hours 24 hr. Salary indication Salary gross/monthly based on full-time € 3,706 - € 5,264 Deadline 21 Oct 2026 This vacancy is only available in Dutch. Click here to view the vacancy in Dutch. University of Twente Drienerlolaan 5 7522NB Enschede +31(0)53 489 9111 info@utwente.nl Route Quicklinks Scientific Staff Support Staff Contact Follow us LinkedIn RSS Cookies & Privacy Stay informed. After registration you will regularly receive our new vacancies. Subscribe as External applicant UT Employee (will receive internal vacancies) Email address Login Occupation Administrative & facility Assistant professor Associate professor Education EngD Finance HRM IT Lecturer Legal staff Management Marketing and communications PhD Policy and staff PostDoc Professor Research, development, innovation Researcher Technical and laboratory You are signed up for the Job alert Previous Next Sign up"
